@startuml Mobile Login
title Mobile App Login via Google Authentication

actor User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "Google OAuth" as Google
participant "API Backend" as API
participant "Database" as DB

User -> App: Open app and tap "Login with Google"
App -> Google: Request Google authentication
Google -> User: Show Google login screen
User -> Google: Enter credentials
Google -> App: Return ID token

App -> API: POST /api/auth/login/google\n{id_token}
API -> Google: Verify ID token
Google -> API: Token valid, return user info

alt First-time user
    API -> DB: Create new user account
    DB -> API: User created
else Existing user
    API -> DB: Find user by Google sub
    DB -> API: User found
end

API -> API: Generate access token
API -> API: Generate refresh token
API -> DB: Store refresh token
API -> App: Return {access_token, refresh_token}

App -> App: Store tokens securely
App -> User: Navigate to home screen

@enduml
